---
layout: base.njk
title: Design Interior
nav_active: services
permalink: /interior-design/
varianta_oferta: interior-design
---

<style>
.container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8rem 3rem 4rem; }

.section-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: 5rem 0;
}

.section-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
}

.section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.section-sub {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.intro {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 6rem 3rem 5rem;
}
.intro .intro-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    max-width: 800px;
}
.intro h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.btn-cta {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: none;
    padding: 1.2rem 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: var(--transition);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    margin-top: 1rem;
}
.btn-cta:hover {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--accent);
    outline: 1px solid var(--accent);
}

/* SLIDESHOW HERO */
.slideshow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    z-index: 1;
}
.slideshow::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(61, 69, 77, 0.9) 0%, rgba(61, 69, 77, 0.6) 50%, rgba(61, 69, 77, 0.75) 100%);
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: none;
}
.slideshow-track {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    transition: transform 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
.slideshow-slide {
    min-width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}
.slideshow-slide img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
}
.slideshow-controls {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    z-index: 4;
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(233,228,223,0.2);
    color: var(--accent);
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: var(--transition);
    opacity: 0;
}
.slideshow:hover .slideshow-controls { opacity: 1; }
.slideshow-controls:hover {
    background: rgba(233,228,223,0.1);
    border-color: rgba(233,228,223,0.45);
}
.slideshow-prev { left: 2rem; }
.slideshow-next { right: 2rem; }
.slideshow-dots {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2.5rem;
    right: 3rem;
    z-index: 4;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    align-items: center;
}
.slideshow-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(233,228,223,0.3);
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: var(--transition);
    padding: 0;
}
.slideshow-dot.active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
.slideshow-counter {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2.5rem;
    left: 3rem;
    z-index: 4;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    opacity: 0.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
}

/* SPLIT TEXT + IMAGINE */
.split-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 3rem;
}
.split-text .check-list { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.check-list {
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 2.1;
    columns: 2;
    column-gap: 2rem;
}
.check-list li::before { content: '— '; opacity: 0.4; }
.split-img {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 6/7;
    max-width: 480px;
    justify-self: end;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.split-img img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
.split-img:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.04);
}

/* GRID SERVICII DESIGN */
.lucrari-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 3rem;
}
.lucrare-card {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: var(--transition);
}
.lucrare-card:nth-child(2n) { border-right: none; }
.lucrare-card:nth-last-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: none; }
.lucrare-card:hover { background: var(--surface); }
.lucrare-thumb {
    aspect-ratio: 16/9;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.lucrare-thumb img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.05) brightness(0.55);
    transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), filter 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
.lucrare-card:hover .lucrare-thumb img {
    filter: grayscale(0%) contrast(1) brightness(0.95);
    transform: scale(1.06);
}
.lucrare-body { padding: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; }
.lucrare-num {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    opacity: 0.35;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
}
.lucrare-body h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
}
.lucrare-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
}
.lucrare-body ul {
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.9;
}
.lucrare-body ul li::before { content: '— '; opacity: 0.4; }
.lucrare-note {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    opacity: 0.8;
}

/* BANNER CITAT PE IMAGINE */
.banner {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 46vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 5rem;
}
.banner > img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.05) brightness(0.35);
}
.banner::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(rgba(61, 69, 77, 0.15), rgba(61, 69, 77, 0.55));
    z-index: 1;
}
.banner-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    max-width: 800px;
}
.banner-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.25;
}

/* PORTOFOLIU */
.portfolio-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 3rem;
}
.portfolio-item {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    overflow: hidden;
    cursor: pointer;
}
.portfolio-item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.1) brightness(0.5);
    transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), filter 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
.portfolio-item:hover img {
    filter: grayscale(0%) contrast(1) brightness(0.95);
    transform: scale(1.08);
}
.portfolio-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(61, 69, 77, 0.9));
    z-index: 2;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: var(--transition);
}
.portfolio-item:hover .portfolio-overlay {
    transform: translateY(0);
    opacity: 1;
}
.portfolio-overlay h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
}
.portfolio-overlay span {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    opacity: 0.6;
}

/* PAȘI — CUM LUCRĂM */
.pasi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 3rem;
}
.pas-card {
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: var(--transition);
}
.pas-card:nth-child(3n) { border-right: none; }
.pas-card:nth-last-child(-n+3) { border-bottom: none; }
.pas-card:hover { background: var(--surface); }
.pas-num {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    opacity: 0.35;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.pas-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
}
.pas-card p {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.7;
}

/* MOTIVE */
.motive-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 3rem;
}
.motiv-card {
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: var(--transition);
}
.motiv-card:last-child { border-right: none; }
.motiv-card:hover { background: var(--surface); }
.motiv-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}
.motiv-card p {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.65;
}

/* CITAT COSTURI */
.quote-box {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 3rem;
}
.quote-box .q-main {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.9rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.quote-box .q-sub {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

/* STATISTICI */
.stats-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: 5rem 0;
}
.stat-item {
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: var(--transition);
}
.stat-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
.stat-item:hover { background: var(--surface); }
.stat-num {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
.stat-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--text-dim);
}

/* CTA FINAL */
.cta-final {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 5rem 3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
}
.cta-final h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.cta-final p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

@keyframes fadeSlideIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .portfolio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .motive-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .motiv-card { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .motiv-card:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .motiv-card:nth-child(even) { border-right: none; }
    .motiv-card:nth-last-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: none; }
    .motive-grid .motiv-card:last-child { border-right: none; }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .container { padding: 6rem 1.5rem 3rem; }
    .intro { min-height: 70vh; padding: 5rem 1.5rem 3rem; }
    .intro h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .section-title { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.5rem); }
    .section-label { font-size: 0.6rem; }
    .section-sub { font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .split-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
    .split-img { justify-self: stretch; max-width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/10; }
    .check-list { columns: 1; }
    .lucrari-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .lucrare-card { border-right: none; }
    .lucrare-card:nth-last-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .lucrare-card:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .banner { min-height: 320px; }
    .portfolio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .slideshow-controls { opacity: 1; width: 36px; height: 36px; }
    .slideshow-prev { left: 1rem; }
    .slideshow-next { right: 1rem; }
    .slideshow-dots { bottom: 1.5rem; right: 1.5rem; }
    .slideshow-counter { bottom: 1.5rem; left: 1.5rem; }
    .pasi-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pas-card { border-right: none; }
    .pas-card:nth-last-child(-n+3) { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .pas-card:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .motive-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .motiv-card { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .motiv-card:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .quote-box { padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem; }
    .stats-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .stat-item { padding: 2rem 1rem; }
    .stat-item:nth-child(2) { border-right: none; }
    .stat-item:nth-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .stat-num { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    .cta-final { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
}
</style>

<section class="intro">
    <div class="slideshow" id="project-slideshow">
        <div class="slideshow-track" id="slideshow-track">
            {% for i in [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6] %}
            <div class="slideshow-slide{% if i == 1 %} active-slide{% endif %}">
                <img src="/images/interior-design/hero-0{{ i }}.jpg" alt="Design interior — proiect {{ i }}" loading="lazy"
                     onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/interior-design/ph/hero-0{{ i }}.svg';">
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <button class="slideshow-controls slideshow-prev" onclick="prevSlide()" aria-label="Slide anterior">&#8592;</button>
        <button class="slideshow-controls slideshow-next" onclick="nextSlide()" aria-label="Slide următor">&#8594;</button>
        <div class="slideshow-dots" id="slideshow-dots"></div>
        <div class="slideshow-counter" id="slideshow-counter">1 / 6</div>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-content">
        <span class="section-label">Servicii de Design</span>
        <h1>Design<br>Interior</h1>
        <p class="section-sub" style="font-size: 1.1rem;">Proiectăm interioare în care îți place să locuiești, să lucrezi și să îți primești oaspeții.</p>
        <p class="section-sub" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
            De la concept și planuri de mobilare până la randări 3D fotorealistice și documentația completă de execuție — un proiect de design interior adaptat spațiului, stilului și bugetului tău.
        </p>
        <button class="btn-cta" onclick="openModal()">Solicită o Ofertă</button>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="container">

    <hr class="section-divider">

    <!-- I. DOMENII DE APLICARE -->
    <span class="section-label">Domenii de Aplicare</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Design interior<br>pentru orice spațiu</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Proiectăm amenajări interioare pentru diverse tipuri de spații, de la locuințe până la spații comerciale.</p>

    <div class="split-grid">
        <div class="split-text">
            <ul class="check-list">
                <li>Apartamente</li>
                <li>Case</li>
                <li>Birouri</li>
                <li>Spații comerciale</li>
                <li>Spații noi</li>
                <li>Spații existente care necesită renovare</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom: 0;">Analizăm spațiul și nevoile tale, apoi dezvoltăm un proiect complet — de la concept la documentația de execuție.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-img">
            <img src="/images/interior-design/spatii-01.jpg" alt="Interior proiectat de CONSARHOUSE" loading="lazy"
                 onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/interior-design/ph/spatii-01.svg';">
        </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="section-divider">

    <!-- II. CE SERVICII OFERIM -->
    <span class="section-label">Ce Servicii Oferim</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Zece servicii.<br>Un proiect complet.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Preluăm proiectul integral sau doar serviciile de care ai nevoie — de la conceptul inițial până la alegerea finisajelor.</p>

    <div class="lucrari-grid">
        <div class="lucrare-card">
            <div class="lucrare-thumb"><img src="/images/interior-design/thumb-01.jpg" alt="Concept de design interior" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/interior-design/ph/thumb-01.svg';"></div>
            <div class="lucrare-body">
                <div class="lucrare-num">[01]</div>
                <h3>Concept de design interior</h3>
                <p class="lucrare-desc">Stabilim direcția vizuală a proiectului:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Moodboard și planșe de concept</li>
                    <li>Stil și paletă cromatică</li>
                    <li>Zonare funcțională</li>
                    <li>Plan de mobilare</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lucrare-card">
            <div class="lucrare-thumb"><img src="/images/interior-design/thumb-02.jpg" alt="Amenajare apartamente" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/interior-design/ph/thumb-02.svg';"></div>
            <div class="lucrare-body">
                <div class="lucrare-num">[02]</div>
                <h3>Amenajare apartamente</h3>
                <p class="lucrare-desc">Proiecte de amenajare pentru apartamente de orice tip:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Studio și garsoniere</li>
                    <li>Apartamente cu 2–4 camere</li>
                    <li>Penthouses și duplexuri</li>
                    <li>Soluții pentru spații mici</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="lucrare-note">Folosim fiecare metru pătrat în mod inteligent, fără compromisuri la confort.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lucrare-card">
            <div class="lucrare-thumb"><img src="/images/interior-design/thumb-03.jpg" alt="Design interior pentru case" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/interior-design/ph/thumb-03.svg';"></div>
            <div class="lucrare-body">
                <div class="lucrare-num">[03]</div>
                <h3>Design interior pentru case</h3>
                <p class="lucrare-desc">Amenajări complete pentru case individuale:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Proiect pe niveluri</li>
                    <li>Zonare zi / noapte</li>
                    <li>Hol, living, bucătărie, dormitoare</li>
                    <li>Spații tehnice și depozitare</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lucrare-card">
            <div class="lucrare-thumb"><img src="/images/interior-design/thumb-04.jpg" alt="Design pentru bucătării" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/interior-design/ph/thumb-04.svg';"></div>
            <div class="lucrare-body">
                <div class="lucrare-num">[04]</div>
                <h3>Design pentru bucătării</h3>
                <p class="lucrare-desc">Bucătării funcționale, gândite pentru utilizarea zilnică:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Triunghiul de lucru</li>
                    <li>Mobilier la comandă</li>
                    <li>Integrarea electrocasnicelor</li>
                    <li>Iluminat funcțional și decorativ</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
